<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Продвинутый Симулятор: ПК и Память компьютера (6 класс)</title>
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Tailwind CSS for Grid and Flex layout -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <style>
        /* Mandatory Styling Guardrails */
        * {
            font-family: Georgia, serif !important;
            user-select: none;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #E6E6FA;
            color: #000080;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .main-heading {
            color: #800000;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .text-dark-blue {
            color: #000080;
        }

        .bg-light-lavender {
            background-color: #F3EFFA;
        }

        .border-dark-red {
            border-color: #800000;
        }

        .btn-red {
            background-color: #800000;
            color: #ffffff;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .btn-red:hover {
            background-color: #600000;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .btn-red:disabled {
            background-color: #a37272;
            cursor: not-allowed;
            transform: none;
        }

        .btn-blue {
            background-color: #000080;
            color: #ffffff;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .btn-blue:hover {
            background-color: #000060;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* Drag and Drop Slots */
        .drop-slot {
            border: 2px dashed #800000;
            background-color: rgba(243, 239, 250, 0.7);
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
        }

        .drop-slot.drag-over {
            background-color: #d8b4fe;
            border-style: solid;
            transform: scale(1.02);
        }

        .drop-slot.filled {
            border: 2px solid #16a34a;
            background-color: #dcfce7;
        }

        .draggable-item {
            cursor: grab;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
        }

        .draggable-item:active {
            cursor: grabbing;
        }

        .draggable-item.placed {
            opacity: 0.4;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* Certificate Layout */
        .certificate-border {
            border: 10px double #800000;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #f3effa 100%);
        }

        /* Custom Scrollbar */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 8px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #E6E6FA;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #800000;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        @keyframes pulse-success {
            0% { transform: scale(1); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.04); }
            100% { transform: scale(1); }
        }
        .anim-success {
            animation: pulse-success 0.3s ease-in-out;
        }

        @media print {
            header, button, #start-screen {
                display: none !important;
            }
            body {
                background: white !important;
            }
            #final-screen {
                display: block !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="flex flex-col min-h-screen">

    <!-- Header / Dashboard Bar -->
    <header class="bg-white border-b-4 border-dark-red shadow-md p-3 md:p-4 sticky top-0 z-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center gap-3">
            <div>
                <h1 class="text-xl md:text-2xl main-heading flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-microchip"></i>
                    Эксперт ПК: Сборщик & Знаток Памяти
                </h1>
                <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-dark-blue">
                    Информатика 6 класс • <span id="user-info-display" class="font-bold text-dark-red">Регистрация не пройдена</span>
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Dashboard Stats -->
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 md:gap-6 bg-light-lavender px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border border-purple-200">
                <div class="text-center">
                    <span class="block text-[11px] text-dark-blue font-bold">Уровень</span>
                    <span id="level-display" class="text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-dark-red">1 / 5</span>
                </div>
                <div class="h-7 w-px bg-purple-300"></div>
                <div class="text-center">
                    <span class="block text-[11px] text-dark-blue font-bold">Очки</span>
                    <span id="score-display" class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-dark-blue">0</span>
                </div>
                <div class="h-7 w-px bg-purple-300"></div>
                <div class="text-center">
                    <span class="block text-[11px] text-dark-blue font-bold"><i class="fa-regular fa-clock"></i> Время</span>
                    <span id="timer-display" class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-dark-red">20:00</span>
                </div>
                <button onclick="togglePause()" id="pause-btn" class="btn-blue text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-pause"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Interactive Area -->
    <main class="flex-grow max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto p-4 md:p-6 flex flex-col justify-center">

        <!-- Registration & Start Screen -->
        <div id="start-screen" class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-6 md:p-8 border-2 border-purple-200 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto my-auto">
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl main-heading mb-2">Регистрация Учащегося</h2>
            <p class="text-dark-blue text-xs md:text-sm mb-6">
                Введите свои данные для формирования итогового персонального сертификата
            </p>

            <!-- Registration Form Inputs -->
            <div class="bg-light-lavender p-5 rounded-2xl border border-purple-200 text-left max-w-xl mx-auto mb-6 space-y-4 shadow-inner">
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-dark-blue mb-1">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-user text-dark-red"></i> Фамилия и Имя ученика <span class="text-red-600">*</span>
                    </label>
                    <input type="text" id="student-name" oninput="validateForm()" placeholder="Например: Иванов Арман" 
                           class="w-full border-2 border-purple-300 rounded-xl p-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-dark-blue outline-none focus:border-red-800 bg-white">
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-dark-blue mb-1">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap text-dark-red"></i> Класс <span class="text-red-600">*</span>
                    </label>
                    <div class="flex gap-2">
                        <input type="text" id="student-class" oninput="validateForm()" placeholder="Например: 6 'А'" 
                               class="flex-grow border-2 border-purple-300 rounded-xl p-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-dark-blue outline-none focus:border-red-800 bg-white">
                        
                        <!-- Quick Class Choice Buttons -->
                        <div class="flex gap-1">
                            <button onclick="quickSetClass('6 «А»')" class="btn-blue text-xs px-2.5 rounded-lg font-bold">6 А</button>
                            <button onclick="quickSetClass('6 «Б»')" class="btn-blue text-xs px-2.5 rounded-lg font-bold">6 Б</button>
                            <button onclick="quickSetClass('6 «В»')" class="btn-blue text-xs px-2.5 rounded-lg font-bold">6 В</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Overview Grid -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-left mb-6 text-xs">
                <div class="bg-light-lavender p-3 rounded-xl border border-purple-200">
                    <span class="font-bold text-dark-red block text-sm">Уровень 1</span>
                    <b>Точная сборка ПК</b> (Строгий порядок + нанесение термопасты!)
                </div>
                <div class="bg-light-lavender p-3 rounded-xl border border-purple-200">
                    <span class="font-bold text-dark-red block text-sm">Уровень 2</span>
                    <b>Матрица памяти</b> (2D-классификация по 2 критериям)
                </div>
                <div class="bg-light-lavender p-3 rounded-xl border border-purple-200">
                    <span class="font-bold text-dark-red block text-sm">Уровень 3</span>
                    <b>Скорость & Единицы</b> (Иерархия быстрой памяти + задачи)
                </div>
                <div class="bg-light-lavender p-3 rounded-xl border border-purple-200">
                    <span class="font-bold text-dark-red block text-sm">Уровень 4</span>
                    <b>IT-Диагностика</b> (Устранение сбоев как инженер)
                </div>
                <div class="bg-light-lavender p-3 rounded-xl border border-purple-200 sm:col-span-2 md:col-span-2">
                    <span class="font-bold text-dark-red block text-sm">Уровень 5</span>
                    <b>Таза Қазақстан E-Waste</b> (3 контейнера экологической чистки)
                </div>
            </div>

            <button id="start-btn" disabled onclick="startGame()" class="btn-red text-lg font-bold px-8 py-3 rounded-xl shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mx-auto">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i> Начать испытание
            </button>
        </div>

        <!-- LEVEL 1: Strict Sequence PC Assembly -->
        <div id="level-1" class="hidden flex-grow flex flex-col gap-4">
            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-purple-200 flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold main-heading">Уровень 1: Точная сборка системного блока и термоинтерфейс</h2>
                    <p class="text-xs text-dark-blue">Соблюдай строгий порядок. Нельзя ставить кулер без нанесения термопасты!</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-purple-100 text-purple-900 text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-bold" id="assembly-step-indicator">
                    Шаг 1 из 8: Установка процессора (CPU)
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-4 flex-grow">
                <!-- Motherboard Workspace -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-8 bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl p-5 relative flex flex-col justify-between shadow-2xl border-4 border-slate-700 min-h-[480px]">
                    <div class="text-emerald-400 font-mono text-[11px] flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span><i class="fa-solid fa-circuit-board"></i> MOTHERBOARD ATX PRO-Z690</span>
                        <span id="thermal-paste-status" class="text-amber-400 font-bold">Термопаста: НЕ нанесена</span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Motherboard Slots Grid -->
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-3 my-auto pt-2">
                        <!-- Socket & CPU Slot -->
                        <div class="col-span-6 border border-emerald-500/40 bg-slate-800/80 p-2 rounded-xl text-center">
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-400 block mb-1">СОКЕТ ЦП & СИСТЕМА ОХЛАЖДЕНИЯ</span>
                            <div id="slot-cpu-zone" data-accept="cpu_group" class="drop-slot w-full h-28 rounded-lg flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-2 text-center text-xs text-dark-blue font-bold">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-microchip text-2xl text-slate-500 mb-1"></i>
                                Гнездо Процессора
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- RAM Slot -->
                        <div class="col-span-6 border border-amber-500/40 bg-slate-800/80 p-2 rounded-xl text-center">
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-400 block mb-1">СЛОТЫ ОЗУ (DIMM DDR5)</span>
                            <div id="slot-ram" data-accept="ram" class="drop-slot w-full h-28 rounded-lg flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-2 text-center text-xs text-dark-blue font-bold">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-memory text-2xl text-slate-500 mb-1"></i>
                                Слоты Оперативной памяти
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- GPU Slot -->
                        <div class="col-span-7 border border-purple-500/40 bg-slate-800/80 p-2 rounded-xl text-center mt-1">
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-purple-400 block mb-1">СЛОТ PCI-EXPRESS X16</span>
                            <div id="slot-gpu" data-accept="gpu" class="drop-slot w-full h-20 rounded-lg flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-2 text-center text-xs text-dark-blue font-bold">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-tv text-2xl text-slate-500 mb-1"></i>
                                Разъем Видеокарты
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- M.2 SSD Slot -->
                        <div class="col-span-5 border border-blue-500/40 bg-slate-800/80 p-2 rounded-xl text-center mt-1">
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-blue-400 block mb-1">СЛОТ M.2 NVMe</span>
                            <div id="slot-ssd" data-accept="ssd" class="drop-slot w-full h-20 rounded-lg flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-2 text-center text-xs text-dark-blue font-bold">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-hard-drive text-2xl text-slate-500 mb-1"></i>
                                Слот NVMe SSD
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- PSU & Cables Slot -->
                        <div class="col-span-12 border border-red-500/40 bg-slate-800/80 p-2 rounded-xl text-center mt-1">
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-red-400 block mb-1">ОТСЕК БП И ПИТАНИЕ ATX</span>
                            <div id="slot-power" data-accept="power_group" class="drop-slot w-full h-16 rounded-lg flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-1 text-center text-xs text-dark-blue font-bold">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-plug text-xl text-slate-500 mb-1"></i>
                                Подключение Блока Питания и Кабелей
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Parts Drawer -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-4 bg-white rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-lg border border-purple-200 flex flex-col">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-sm main-heading border-b border-purple-200 pb-2 mb-3">Комплектующие:</h3>
                    <div id="hardware-drawer" class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 overflow-y-auto max-h-[420px] pr-1">
                        <!-- Items rendered by JS -->
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- LEVEL 2: 2D Memory Matrix -->
        <div id="level-2" class="hidden flex-grow flex flex-col gap-4">
            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-purple-200">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-bold main-heading">Уровень 2: Двумерная Матрица Классификации Памяти</h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-dark-blue">Перетащи карточки устройств в правильную ячейку матрицы.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-4 flex-grow">
                <!-- 2x2 Matrix Area -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-8 bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl border border-purple-200 shadow-md grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                    <!-- Cell 1: Internal + Volatile -->
                    <div id="matrix-int-vol" data-loc="internal" data-vol="volatile" class="drop-slot rounded-xl p-3 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[180px]">
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-dark-red border-b border-purple-200 pb-1">1. Внутренняя + Энергозависимая</span>
                        <div class="matrix-list flex flex-wrap gap-1 mt-2"></div>
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 italic mt-1">Очищается при выключении ПК</span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Cell 2: Internal + Non-Volatile -->
                    <div id="matrix-int-non" data-loc="internal" data-vol="non-volatile" class="drop-slot rounded-xl p-3 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[180px]">
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-dark-red border-b border-purple-200 pb-1">2. Внутренняя + Энергонезависимая</span>
                        <div class="matrix-list flex flex-wrap gap-1 mt-2"></div>
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 italic mt-1">Сохраняет данные без тока</span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Cell 3: External + Volatile -->
                    <div id="matrix-ext-vol" data-loc="external" data-vol="volatile" class="drop-slot rounded-xl p-3 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[180px]">
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-dark-red border-b border-purple-200 pb-1">3. Внешняя + Энергозависимая</span>
                        <div class="matrix-list flex flex-wrap gap-1 mt-2"></div>
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 italic mt-1">Внешние временные буферы</span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Cell 4: External + Non-Volatile -->
                    <div id="matrix-ext-non" data-loc="external" data-vol="non-volatile" class="drop-slot rounded-xl p-3 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[180px]">
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-dark-red border-b border-purple-200 pb-1">4. Внешняя + Энергонезависимая</span>
                        <div class="matrix-list flex flex-wrap gap-1 mt-2"></div>
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 italic mt-1">Переносные диски и флешки</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Matrix Cards Drawer -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-4 bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl border border-purple-200 shadow-md flex flex-col">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-xs main-heading mb-2">Карточки памяти для распределения:</h3>
                    <div id="matrix-cards-drawer" class="flex flex-col gap-2 overflow-y-auto max-h-[380px]">
                        <!-- Rendered by JS -->
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- LEVEL 3: Speed Hierarchy & Unit Calculations -->
        <div id="level-3" class="hidden flex-grow flex flex-col gap-4">
            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-purple-200">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-bold main-heading">Уровень 3: Иерархия Скорости и Расчет Единиц Памяти</h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-dark-blue">Расставь накопители по скорости и реши 3 задачи на пересчет байтов.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4 flex-grow">
                <!-- Part A: Speed Hierarchy -->
                <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl border border-purple-200 shadow-md flex flex-col">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-xs main-heading mb-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-gauge-high"></i> Часть А: Иерархия быстродействия</h3>
                    
                    <div id="speed-slots-container" class="flex flex-col gap-2 flex-grow">
                        <div data-speed-rank="1" class="speed-slot drop-slot p-2 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                            <span class="font-bold text-dark-red">1 место (Сверхбыстрая)</span>
                            <div class="slot-content font-bold text-emerald-700"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div data-speed-rank="2" class="speed-slot drop-slot p-2 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                            <span class="font-bold text-dark-red">2 место (Быстрая)</span>
                            <div class="slot-content font-bold text-emerald-700"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div data-speed-rank="3" class="speed-slot drop-slot p-2 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                            <span class="font-bold text-dark-red">3 место (Средняя)</span>
                            <div class="slot-content font-bold text-emerald-700"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div data-speed-rank="4" class="speed-slot drop-slot p-2 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                            <span class="font-bold text-dark-red">4 место (Медленная)</span>
                            <div class="slot-content font-bold text-emerald-700"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div data-speed-rank="5" class="speed-slot drop-slot p-2 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                            <span class="font-bold text-dark-red">5 место (Самая медленная)</span>
                            <div class="slot-content font-bold text-emerald-700"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="speed-items-drawer" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-3 pt-2 border-t border-purple-200">
                        <!-- Speed Items Rendered by JS -->
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Part B: Unit Calculator Quiz -->
                <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl border border-purple-200 shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-xs main-heading mb-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-calculator"></i> Часть Б: Пересчет единиц измерения информации</h3>
                        
                        <div class="space-y-4 text-xs">
                            <div class="bg-light-lavender p-3 rounded-xl border border-purple-200">
                                <label class="font-bold block text-dark-blue mb-1">Задача 1: Сколько Мегабайт (МБ) содержится в 2 Гигабайтах (ГБ)?</label>
                                <div class="flex gap-2">
                                    <input type="number" id="unit-q1" class="border border-purple-300 p-1.5 rounded w-full text-center font-bold" placeholder="Ответ...">
                                    <span class="self-center font-bold">МБ</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="bg-light-lavender p-3 rounded-xl border border-purple-200">
                                <label class="font-bold block text-dark-blue mb-1">Задача 2: Сколько Байт содержится в 1024 Битах?</label>
                                <div class="flex gap-2">
                                    <input type="number" id="unit-q2" class="border border-purple-300 p-1.5 rounded w-full text-center font-bold" placeholder="Ответ...">
                                    <span class="self-center font-bold">Байт</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="bg-light-lavender p-3 rounded-xl border border-purple-200">
                                <label class="font-bold block text-dark-blue mb-1">Задача 3: Сколько Килобайт (КБ) занимает документ размером 3072 Байта?</label>
                                <div class="flex gap-2">
                                    <input type="number" id="unit-q3" class="border border-purple-300 p-1.5 rounded w-full text-center font-bold" placeholder="Ответ...">
                                    <span class="self-center font-bold">КБ</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <button onclick="checkLevel3All()" class="btn-red w-full py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold mt-4">
                        Проверить Уровень 3
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- LEVEL 4: IT Diagnostics Scenario Cases -->
        <div id="level-4" class="hidden flex-grow flex flex-col gap-4">
            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-purple-200">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-bold main-heading">Уровень 4: Лаборатория IT-Диагностики и Ремонта</h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-dark-blue">Проанализируй проблему пользователя и выбери верное решение.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-purple-200 shadow-md max-w-2xl mx-auto w-full my-auto text-center">
